@startuml
autonumber
actor Tenant
participant "UI (Mobile App)" as UI
participant "Auth Module" as Auth
participant "Room Management" as Room
participant "Complaint Ticketing" as Complaint
participant "Notification Module" as Notification

Tenant -> UI: Input keluhan (judul, deskripsi, foto & no. kamar)
UI -> Auth: Verifikasi Sesi/Identitas Tenant
Auth --> UI: Token/Sesi Valid
UI -> Room: Validasi Nomor Kamar
Room --> UI: Kamar Valid & Sesuai
UI -> Complaint: createComplaint(tenantId, roomNo, description, photo)
Complaint -> Complaint: Simpan Tiket Keluhan (Status: Pending)
Complaint -> Notification: Trigger Kirim Notifikasi ke Pemilik
Notification --> Complaint: Notifikasi Terkirim
Complaint --> UI: Tiket Berhasil Dibuat
UI --> Tenant: Tampilkan Status Tiket "Pending"
@enduml
